            0.161
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In which way is the Earth turning around itself? To visualise this, let us recall some of the objects which turn around themselves. Have you watched a top spinning around its spindle (Fig. 12.2a)? Or a spinning fan (Fig. 12.2b)? Or tried spinning a ball (Fig. 12.2c)?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.361,
            0.177,
